{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-fidlock-hermetic-dry-bag-2609-0075","content_id":"59f0c2d2-0008-43e5-bbbb-c838f5d072f8","description":"Product Recall for Fidlock Hermetic Dry Bag presenting a serious risk of injuries.\r\n","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"727b6199-38d3-4deb-b9ea-db88f27bea9e","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2026-09-10T16:35:51+01:00","id":"727b6199-38d3-4deb-b9ea-db88f27bea9e","title":"Link to Product Image and PDF","updated_at":"2026-09-10T16:35:51+01:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6aa2ce5792e72b8ac437f12c/2609-0075-product-recall-fidlock-hermetic-dry-bag.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: Fidlock Hermetic Dry Bag</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: The product presents a serious risk of injuries due to accessible small magnets.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action: The product has been recalled from end users by Fidlock GmbH.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Hobby/sports equipment - Swimming/Surfing/Diving Sports Equipment - Replacement Parts/Accessories</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Brand</td>\n      <td>Fidlock GmbH</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Size</td>\n      <td>Medi</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Barcode</td>\n      <td>4251207401183</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Item number</td>\n      <td>D-11111A-F0000(PTTT)</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Lot number</td>\n      <td>2409140930201</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Sales period</td>\n      <td>4th December 2024 to 3rd September 2026</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>China</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>Blue waterproof magnetic self-sealing bag. Only products with the lot number 2409140930201 are being recalled.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_727b6199-38d3-4deb-b9ea-db88f27bea9e\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6aa2ce5792e72b8ac437f12c/2609-0075-product-recall-fidlock-hermetic-dry-bag.pdf\">Link to Product Image and PDF</a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>Products from lot number 2409140930201 have a manufacturing defect affecting the adhesive bond between the closure strips and the bag film. As a result, the closure strips may detach partially or completely during use, causing the product to lose its intended function and potentially releasing the enclosed magnets.</p>\n\n<p>The magnets constitute small parts and present a risk of injuries if swallowed, especially by young children. If one or more magnets are swallowed, they can attract each other within the body, causing serious internal injuries.</p>\n\n<p>The product does not meet the requirements of the General Product Safety Regulations 2005.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>The product has been recalled from end users by Fidlock GmbH.</p>\n\n<p>Consumers should cease use of the product immediately, keep it out of reach of children, and dispose of it safely. Contact Fidlock directly via <a href=\"mailto:recall_2609@fidlock.com\">recall_2609@fidlock.com</a> to register for a refund or replacement.</p>\n\n<p>For more information, please visit <a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://www.fidlock.com/consumer/en/recall\">⁣Recall: HERMETIC dry bag medi</a>.</p>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD notification number: 2609-0075</p>\n\n<p>Notified by: Office for Product Safety and Standards</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-09-10T15:36:40Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-recall","product_category":"hobby-sports-equipment","product_measure_type":["recall-of-product-from-end-users"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2026-09-10","product_risk_level":"serious"},"temporary_update_type":false},"document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","first_published_at":"2026-09-10T16:36:40+01:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-fidlock-hermetic-dry-bag-2609-0075","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-fidlock-hermetic-dry-bag-2609-0075","base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-fidlock-hermetic-dry-bag-2609-0075","content_id":"59f0c2d2-0008-43e5-bbbb-c838f5d072f8","document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2026-09-10T15:36:40Z","schema_name":"specialist_document","title":"Product Recall: Fidlock Hermetic Dry Bag (2609-0075)","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-fidlock-hermetic-dry-bag-2609-0075","withdrawn":false}],"finder":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","content_id":"a22b3f1f-2c91-49a1-a469-ff21d465c543","details":{"facets":[{"allowed_values":[{"label":"Product safety alert","value":"product-safety-alert"},{"label":"Product safety report","value":"product-safety-report"},{"label":"Product recall","value":"product-recall"}],"display_as_result_metadata":true,"filterable":true,"key":"product_alert_type","name":"Alert type","preposition":"of t